//! Reference heads and tails: the official Standard (free) shapes the studio pairs an
//! upload with and the guide illustrates. A static table, so nothing is processed at
//! runtime.
//!
//! Generated by processing the raw catalog SVGs vendored in
//! `server/tests/fixtures/design_kit/refs/` with [`super::process_upload`];
//! `server/tests/design_kit_refs.rs` checks the table against fresh output (and that each
//! is `VectorExact` with no warnings). To regenerate after a pipeline change:
//!
//! ```text
//! cargo test -p arena --test design_kit_refs -- --ignored --nocapture print_refs_table
//! ```
//!
//! Display names match `customizations::catalog` (checked by a test there).

